            <ArticleTitle>The incidence of pain in the muscles of mastication in patients with fibromyalgia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>8-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study recognizes the high incidence of temporomandibular symptoms in a group of patients with documented fibromyalgia. Findings indicate that the diagnosis and treatment of temporomandibular disorders and fibromyalgia have many similarities.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
